% TOPQ-2018-05 fig_01a: four-top production, gg -> t tbar t tbar with a t-channel gluon between two top lines
layout: v2
in: i1 i2
out: f1 f2 f3 f4
i1 [g] -- [gluon] a
i2 [g] -- [gluon] d
f2 [\bar t] -- [fermion, color=blue] b -- [fermion, color=blue] a -- [fermion, color=blue] f1 [t]
f4 [\bar t] -- [fermion, color=blue] d -- [fermion, color=blue] c -- [fermion, color=blue] f3 [t]
b -- [gluon] c
